  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Zimbabwe Resilience Building Fund Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the programme is to build resilience in vulnerable rural communities, ensure sustainable natural resources management for climate action, improve food and nutrition security, and lower the impact of natural disasters in at-risk communities in Zimbabwe. This will be achieved through the following interlinked Outcome areas: Outcome 1: Evidence and capacity built for key institutions, systems, and communities for policy and programming that promote community stewardship on sustainable n</narrative>
  </description>
